        <mxCell id="resolvesBox" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#D64309&quot;&gt;What temporal precedence resolves:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Sepsis dx precedes abx order precedes outcome — the only ordering compatible with observed event times. &#39;Time-to-antibiotic&#39; becomes the identifiable estimand." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF4E6;fontColor=#3F4444;strokeColor=#D64309;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Arial;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
